  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds public MC68010 support and refined MC68020, MC68030, and MC68040 interpreter backends. Improves MC68000 interpreter and JIT timing, two-word prefetch behavior, exception handling, self-modifying-code invalidation, and hot-path performance; improves MC68040 JIT memory-loop performance and removes steady-state allocations. Expands conformance coverage with SingleStepTests, Musashi, m68k-rs, and WinUAE CPU tests.",
